---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const crumbs = [{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Terms', url: '/terms/' }];
---
<Base
  title="Inkline terms of use | Inkline"
  description="Terms of use for the Inkline app and this website, including subscription terms handled by the App Store."
  path="/terms/"
  crumbs={crumbs}
>
  <p class="kicker">Terms</p>
  <h1>Terms of use</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Inkline is free to use. Inkline Pro is offered as a monthly (£2.99) or annual (£14.99) subscription in the UK, each starting with a one-week free introductory offer, billed and managed through the App Store under Apple's standard end-user licence agreement. Cancellation is handled in your device's subscription settings and takes effect at the end of the paid period.</p>
    <p>The directory on this site is provided for reference. Verification dates state when a source was last checked by hand; publishers change their provision without notice and no warranty is made beyond the dated check itself. Publication names and mastheads belong to their publishers, and their appearance here describes coverage rather than implying endorsement.</p>
    <p class="small">Migrated from the previous host with 301 redirects in place. Final legal wording to be confirmed by Michael before launch.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
